{
  "schema": 2,
  "name": "tractor",
  "title": "Gunship 3: tractor beam and tether",
  "description": "Gunship 3 with a tractor beam: hold T and a 30° beam reaches 50 m out behind the ship, pulling on what it touches with a total force shared between them, and pulling the ship back just as hard. An object no bigger than the ship and no more than 1.2 times its mass that comes within 15 m is taken on a tether: a stiff, damped spring that holds it at 15 m and lets it swing round the ship. Press T again to let it go. Too hard a pull breaks the tether. To pick up: an asteroid fragment, a derelict ship, and a dense ball as heavy as the ship and half its size; the big rock is too heavy to tow, so the beam pulls the ship to it instead. Rubble asteroids to fly round, and a base platform to bring cargo back to. No gravity.",
